		(property "Description" "USB - Type A Connectors\n\nMale types stick out and are inserted into a PC or matching females parts (these are the connectors used on USB Memory Sticks, etc.).  Female parts are generally used for USB Host and accept a male-type connector.\n\n• SMT - 4UCON: 10017\n• PTHFML - Digikey: 609-1045-ND, 4UCon: 05241\n• PCB - Use 2.0mm thick PCBs with this footprint"
